# docs/12-CODING-STANDARDS.md 11장 — CI 에서 경고로 보고한다
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  performance-*,
  modernize-use-nullptr,
  modernize-use-override,
  modernize-use-using,
  modernize-use-equals-default,
  cppcoreguidelines-owning-memory,
  readability-braces-around-statements
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '^(foundation|core|network|platform|render|editor|apps)/'
FormatStyle: file
